OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and occasional
OL,6,Fshowers, but also plenty of dry and
OL,7,Fbright weather. Strong northwesterly
OL,8,Fwinds at first across Shetland,
OL,9,Fotherwise less windy than of late.
OL,10,FClouding over with more persistent
OL,11,Frain mid afternoon for Orkney.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FRain moving north to
OL,14,FShetland, mostly light and clearing
OL,15,Fall areas later in the evening, Brisk
OL,16,Fwesterly winds continuing through the
OL,17,Fnight with a occasionally showers too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
