OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA blustery day with frequent
OL,6,Fshowers moving through with the strong
OL,7,Fsouthwesterly winds, winds touching
OL,8,Fgales in the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FFurther
OL,11,Fshowers Sunday with strong
OL,12,Fnorthwesterly winds eventually easing
OL,13,Flater. Perhaps becoming a little more
OL,14,Fsettled early next week with some
OL,15,Fbright or sunny weather.
